{"4310920": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Turscar Isle", "steam_appid": 4310920, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Word of Turscar. A deluded cult, seeking to overthrow the global order of the Internet and replace it with mandatory clicking on scams in the name of their god of deceit, Turscar. Why they haven't been wiped out is a mystery, but nobody is going to object to you sneaking onto their island and stealing everything they haven't nailed down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Well, except maybe the spammers themselves. But who cares about <i>them</i>?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lurk</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stick to the shadows, take your time, and don't get caught.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use decoys, flashbangs and throwing knives to buy yourself an edge over the cultists, or simply wait until they walk past to stab them in the back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4310920/extras/01a502b087f44566443353b9cf124def.avif?t=1782976277\" alt=\"A red-robed cultist walks in the distance, while the player crouches next to a crate\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Loot</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steal everything that isn't nailed down. Then come back and steal the nails.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find notes with keycodes, hack their servers, and delve into the darkest corners to find everything they've stashed away, stolen from their victims. Robin Hood would approve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launder your plunder by upgrading your equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4310920/extras/e51df9a4c2a76b863028777cf8a85bd0.avif?t=1782976277\" alt=\"The player leans around a server and starts to hack it\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Leave</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You</i> decide when to pull out. If you wish to explore further for more loot, or pull out earlier? That's your choice!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There may even be more than one way out, if you can find it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4310920/extras/8aaa960a6ab760b4fd46e7502153ead0.avif?t=1782976277\" alt=\"A sewer entrance/exit in the side of a mountain.\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No generative AI used in this. And no, the old-fashioned text-to-speech engine used to voice most of the deranged bots doesn't count.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Word of Turscar. A deluded cult, seeking to overthrow the global order of the Internet and replace it with mandatory clicking on scams in the name of their god of deceit, Turscar. Why they haven't been wiped out is a mystery, but nobody is going to object to you sneaking onto their island and stealing everything they haven't nailed down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Well, except maybe the spammers themselves. But who cares about <i>them</i>?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lurk</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stick to the shadows, take your time, and don't get caught.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use decoys, flashbangs and throwing knives to buy yourself an edge over the cultists, or simply wait until they walk past to stab them in the back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4310920/extras/01a502b087f44566443353b9cf124def.avif?t=1782976277\" alt=\"A red-robed cultist walks in the distance, while the player crouches next to a crate\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Loot</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steal everything that isn't nailed down. Then come back and steal the nails.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find notes with keycodes, hack their servers, and delve into the darkest corners to find everything they've stashed away, stolen from their victims. Robin Hood would approve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launder your plunder by upgrading your equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4310920/extras/e51df9a4c2a76b863028777cf8a85bd0.avif?t=1782976277\" alt=\"The player leans around a server and starts to hack it\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Leave</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You</i> decide when to pull out. If you wish to explore further for more loot, or pull out earlier? That's your choice!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There may even be more than one way out, if you can find it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4310920/extras/8aaa960a6ab760b4fd46e7502153ead0.avif?t=1782976277\" alt=\"A sewer entrance/exit in the side of a mountain.\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No generative AI used in this. And no, the old-fashioned text-to-speech engine used to voice most of the deranged bots doesn't count.</p>", "short_description": "Infiltrate the base of a cult of spammers in this Thief-style stealth extraction game! Exact poetic justice on them by stealing everything they haven't nailed down, then go back and steal the nails.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Irish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4310920/50cb3ba0959d3a52c860769932e3d2515282d8bb/header.jpg?t=1782976277", "capsule_image": "https://sh